����������������������������������������������������������������������� 276\n10 � 1 Setting up GitHub Copilot ���������������������������������������������������������������������������������������� 277\nGetting ready • 277\nHow to do it… • 278\nHow it works… • 286\nTable of Contents xix\nThere’s more… • 286\nSee also • 287\n10 � 2 Setting up Claude Code �������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������� 287\nGetting ready • 287\nHow to do it… • 287\nHow it works… • 290\nThere’s more… • 290\nSee also • 291\n10 � 3 Conversational log analysis and threat detection � ����������������������������������������������������� 291\nGetting ready • 291\nHow to do it… • 292\nHow it works… • 296\nThere’s more… • 297\nSee also • 297\n10 � 4 Rapid security script development for incident response ���������������������������������������� 297\nGetting ready • 297\nHow to do it… • 297\nHow it works… • 299\nThere’s more… • 300\nSee also • 300\nSummary ������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������ 301\nGet This Book’s PDF Version and Exclusive Extras • 301","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":19,"pageEnd":20,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf::13","sourceKey":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf","sourceType":"pdf","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ainetworkingcookbook ainetworkingcookbook","filePath":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf","fileName":"ainetworkingcookbook.pdf","folder":"2 - Source Material/Books","title":"ainetworkingcookbook","heading":"Chapter 11: Unlock Your Exclusive Benefits 303","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Chapter 11: Unlock Your Exclusive Benefits 303\nOther Books You May Enjoy 309\nIndex 313\nPreface\n“Software is eating the world,” said Marc Andreesen in his infamous blog, https://a16z.com/why-\nsoftware-is-eating-the-world/, back in 2011. Fast forward 14 years, the statement is true if we\nsubstitute ‘Software’ with ‘Artificial Intelligence’. After being in the technology field for the better\nparts of the last 25 years, experiencing some of the biggest shifts in the field such as the Internet,\nBroadband, mobile, and social, the latest emphasis on AI feels just as big with any of the other\ntechnologies, if not bigger.\nLike many of my fellow network engineers, I am fascinated by the things AI LLM can do today\nwhile captivated by the imagination of what it can do tomorrow. Yet I am also anxious and deeply\nconcerned about the impact and the unknown it has on the society. The impact is already being\nfelt by the rounds of downsizing, the huge investment by leading technology companies, and the\nclimate impact they are already making.\nRegardless of what the road is ahead of us, the first thing to forming an opinion about a technology\nis to understand it. This book is a result of my own learning path toward AI LLM in the field of\nNetwork Engineering. I want to distill the technology into practical, ready-to-use cookbook style\nrecipes so we can learn them, use them, and increase our quality of life as a result.\nI hope you enjoy the book!\nWho this book is for\nThis book is for network engineers, network operators, and IT professionals looking explore the\nintersection of AI LLM and networking.\nWhat this book covers","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":20,"pageEnd":22,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf::14","sourceKey":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf","sourceType":"pdf","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ainetworkingcookbook ainetworkingcookbook","filePath":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf","fileName":"ainetworkingcookbook.pdf","folder":"2 - Source Material/Books","title":"ainetworkingcookbook","heading":"Chapter 1, The AI LLM Landscape and Key Parameters, details the setting up OpenAI account, ex-","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Chapter 1, The AI LLM Landscape and Key Parameters, details the setting up OpenAI account, ex-\nplore different OpenAI LLM as well as AI Ollama modes, parameters, and using simple script to\ninteract with them.\nPreface xxii","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":22,"pageEnd":23,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf::15","sourceKey":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf","sourceType":"pdf","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ainetworkingcookbook ainetworkingcookbook","filePath":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf","fileName":"ainetworkingcookbook.pdf","folder":"2 - Source Material/Books","title":"ainetworkingcookbook","heading":"Chapter 2, OpenAI Recipes for Network Engineers, explores using OpenAI models to automate routine","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Chapter 2, OpenAI Recipes for Network Engineers, explores using OpenAI models to automate routine\nnetwork engineering tasks.","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":23,"pageEnd":23,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf::16","sourceKey":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf","sourceType":"pdf","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ainetworkingcookbook ainetworkingcookbook","filePath":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf","fileName":"ainetworkingcookbook.pdf","folder":"2 - Source Material/Books","title":"ainetworkingcookbook","heading":"Chapter 3, Prompt Engineering for Reliable Outputs, shows you how to use prompt engineering to","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Chapter 3, Prompt Engineering for Reliable Outputs, shows you how to use prompt engineering to\nmore affectively interact with AI LLM.","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":23,"pageEnd":23,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"2 - Source Material/Books/ainetworkingcookbook.pdf::17","sourceKey":"2 -